Fifth District Bancorp, Inc. (“Fifth District Bancorp,” the “Company” or “we”) was incorporated in February 2024 and became the holding company for Fifth District Savings Bank (“Fifth District” or the “Bank”) upon the conversion of Fifth District from the mutual form of organization to the stock form of organization (the “Conversion”). The Conversion was completed on July 31, 2024, and the Company sold 5,459,473 shares of common stock at a price of $10.00 per share. The Company also issued 100,000 shares of common stock to The Fifth District Community Foundation, Inc.
